  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">StP VK CDSP 1 - CDS IT &amp; Water Demand</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">StP VK CDSP 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att bidra till h&#xe5;llbara system och metoder f&#xf6;r VA-service i St Petersburg, och d&#xe4;rigenom en minskad milj&#xf6;- belastning p&#xe5; &#xd6;stersj&#xf6;n. Det svensk/finsk/brittiska konsortiets insatser g&#xe4;ller dels organisation/management, dels den tekniska verksamheten i VA-bolaget Vodokanal.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The CDS project consists of services to St PVodokanal to support the process initiated in institutional change and modernisation  Sida finances the contract between Vodokanal and Stockholm Water FEDP finances contract w Helsinki Water, DFID with Severn Trent W Int management, operational and technical support services</narrative>
  </description>
